cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite them using the metadata below."
title: "wd-govanstones-static: A static Wikibase of the Govan Stones, taken from Wikidata"
abstract: >-
  A static, read-only Wikibase on GitHub Pages for the Govan Stones, the early medieval carved stones of Govan Old in Glasgow. The items are those of the Wikidata WikiProject GovanStones; each keeps its Wikidata item as a twin. Built with wikibase-static.
type: software
authors:
